{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56642","headline":"古琴袋织成诗 · 无名氏","name":"古琴袋织成诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自来行止赋骄奢，更有何人力可加。\n分得御沟新凿址，占他农地别种花。\n楼台夜宴停红烛，妓女春梢俵绦纱。\n大醉不知光景去，难迹双髩染霜华。\n（宋俞文豹《吹剑三录》，云「疑是孟蜀藩国宗戚所作」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}